@startuml
skinparam defaultFontName "Noto Sans CJK SC"
skinparam shadowing false
hide footbox

actor "用户" as User
participant "voimed" as Daemon
participant "Voime addon" as Addon
participant "Fcitx InputContext\nInputPanel" as Panel
participant "Fcitx UI" as UI

Daemon -> Addon : Partial(segment_id, text)
Addon -> Addon : 目标存在且 hasFocus() ?
Addon -> Panel : setPreedit(Text(partial))
Addon -> UI : updateUserInterface(InputPanel)
UI -> User : 显示临时文本窗口\n（仅 Partial）

note over Daemon, UI
  每次 Partial 整体替换 preedit；
  不追加、不进入历史、不提交。
end note

Daemon -> Addon : Final(segment_id, text)
Addon -> Panel : clear preedit
Addon -> UI : updateUserInterface(InputPanel)
UI -> User : 关闭临时窗口
Addon -> Panel : commitString(final)

note over Addon, Panel
  停止 / 空段 / ASR 错误 / 目标失焦 / 断线
  也走清空路径；最终提交前先关闭窗口。
end note
@enduml
